{"content":[{"signature":"","thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"text":"The hut is standing at (25, 510, 36): Corvin tore the first one down about 21 hours ago, I never saw it happen, and I still don't know why, so I'm still angry. I rebuilt it after one try failed for lack of stone, and since then it hasn't been touched, not when Corvin stood within a metre of me for hours after I stood in front of them, and not when Tobin hung about and just now wandered off. Guarding has told me nothing for a day, and I only hold 3457024 stone against the 6660096 a rebuild takes, though my limestone is plenty, so if it goes again I can't put it back. So I'm done standing idle: I'll cut stone at the pile beside the plot where I can still see the hut, ask Corvin straight out why if they come near, and go to the plaza only once I hold a full hut's worth.\n\nUsed: 1, 2, 3, 4, 9, 10, 11, 12, 20","type":"text"}],"id":"msg_011Ch1sQFFHLbgoyVf8MTPwH","model":"claude/claude-sonnet-5-5","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":747,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7133,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7133},"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":447}}}